= IRC Time =

[WARNING]: this client is no where near complete.
The only things that work currently are the motd, and sending/reciving messages

== Usage

Open a file/buffer called `irc://<server>`, eg `irc://irc.libera.chat`. This
will open a system messages buffer, then to join a channel open a new buffer
called `irc://##the-channel`, eg: `:e irc://\#\#bash`.

Once the channel is joined, another buffer will be opened called
`irc://>##the-channel`. This is the buffer in which you send messages. To send
the message `:w` the buffer.

To message a specific user, open a buffer called `irc://#the-user` (notice it
has one hashtag)
